      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "4 ANCHOR PLANTED",
      "narration_text": "Here's what a skill actually is: one file. Legal-hold, for instance, is a folder holding a single SKILL.md — instructions for drafting the hold notice, logging the case fields, and calendaring the next refresh, all written in plain language Claude reads before it starts.",
