    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "The spec draws its own edges too: it drafts, it logs, it calendars — but it doesn't enforce preservation, doesn't set scope alone, and doesn't send the notice. A person still does every one of those.",
