      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "5 both directions",
      "narration_text": "Watching Claude draft a clean, on-time hold notice doesn't prove it understood the lawsuit — a file can be followed to the letter on a case it never grasped. And watching it stall on a request doesn't prove the skill is broken — it may just be asking for something the written steps don't cover.",
